    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mitchell Douglas is delighted to present this unique and beautifully positioned family home,\r\nset on a generous private site in one of North Wicklow's most sought after locations.\r\nNestled behind double entrance gates and surrounded by mature trees, hedging, and landscaped\r\nlawns, this charming bungalow offers the perfect blend of privacy, convenience and future potential.\r\nThe accommodation comprises of a welcoming living room with feature fireplace, fitted kitchen,\r\nthree bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\nThe substantial site provided excellent scope to extend or further enhance the property, subject\r\nto the necessary planning permission.\r\nLocation is everything, and this home delivers ie. -\r\n12 minutes approx from Bray's iconic seafront, 7 mins. approx from the picturesque village\r\nof Enniskerry and world renowned Powerscourt Estate and gardens and 500 meters approx.\r\nfrom St. Gerard's School.\r\nA short drive to the N11/M50, providing easy access to Dublin, city, airport and beyond.\r\nWhether you are seeking a family home, a property with expansion potential, or a tranquil setting\r\nwithin easy reach of excellent schools and amenities, this home offers a rare opportunity to\r\nenjoy the very best of Wicklow living.  Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation comprises of -\r\n\r\nLivingroom with feature fireplace and large window \r\noverlooking front garden\r\n\r\nFully fitted kitchen with ample storage presses,\r\nsink and drainer.\r\n\r\nBathroom fitted with\r\nShower/screen, w.c. & w.h.b.\r\n\r\n3 Bedrooms."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Situated on a generous private site \r\n3 Bedrooms\r\n1 Bathroom\r\nFully fitted Kitchen\r\nLivingroom with feature fireplace\r\nAmple parking"
      },
      {
